iff on product manufactured in China in the news, we currently do not expect a meaningful impact of our revenue, as Chinese component represent the minimum portions of total values of our manufactured products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/21/fabrinet-fn-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"FN 2018 Q4","e":"fn","d":"2018-08-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Toh-Seng Ng","x":"But we expect, moving forward, we'll fully recover through the learning curve and the cost-reduction efforts and so on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/21/fabrinet-fn-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"FN 2019 Q1","e":"fn","d":"2018-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Seamus Grady","x":"In the last several months, there have been a lot of discussions related to tariffs and products coming to the US from China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/05/fabrinet-fn-q1-2019-earnings-conference-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"FN 2019 Q1","e":"fn","d":"2018-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Seamus Grady","x":"I can report that we have not seen any negative impact from these tariffs and we don't anticipate that we will in the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/05/fabrinet-fn-q1-2019-earnings-conference-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"FN 2019 Q2","e":"fn","d":"2019-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Troy Jensen","x":"I know you're saying end of last year that you kind of had multiple conversations with customers about the China tariffs and I know it'd be kind of a further out opportunity, but just love to get an update there, does any of these conversations get more serious?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/04/fabrinet-fn-q2-2019-earnings-conference-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"FN 2019 Q2","e":"fn","d":"2019-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Seamus Grady","x":"While this can impact our revenue like it did this past quarter, we typically share in the cost savings that we're able to generate with our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/04/fabrinet-fn-q2-2019-earnings-conference-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"FN 2019 Q2","e":"fn","d":"2019-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Seamus Grady","x":"And we continue to make progress in all three, but in terms of bringing up our own facility, it is quite slow going, I would say, because we're being very careful about making sure we have the right facility in the right location and the right size and capability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/04/fabrinet-fn-q2-2019-earnings-conference-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"FN 2019 Q3","e":"fn","d":"2019-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Timothy Savageaux","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/06/fabrinet-fn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FN 2019 Q3","e":"fn","d":"2019-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Seamus Grady","x":"We're working with our customers to make sure when that happens, that we're able to match that for cost reduction so that we preserve our margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/06/fabrinet-fn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FN 2019 Q4","e":"fn","d":"2019-08-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Seamus Grady","x":"It showed -- the tariff situation, we should be a beneficiary of that because we manufacture everything.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/20/fabrinet-fn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FN 2019 Q4","e":"fn","d":"2019-08-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Seamus Grady","x":"But your point is a very good one, yes, certainly the tariffs are a tailwind for us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/20/fabrinet-fn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FN 2019 Q4","e":"fn","d":"2019-08-19"